        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Raangsou kumna samthai e thei ai,",
            "Poubaomei theihpui ching zau tatni,",
            "Hei khou tei kalloumei tei houni,",
            "Zei kumna talandui patmei tei,",
            "Zianmei pheinuaih rui thut nthanni.",
            "He Kalvary! He Kalvary!",
            "Nang ruhkhou nang guangh hianbin lou the,",
            "Thaulana hianmei tei satpat ro,",
            "Kazei luang kaimei thut nthan o.",
            "",
            "2. Kidron dui le nangni thau lana,",
            "Nang Pou tarimei ta tizang tiu,",
            "Tatna kazanh nthanmei bam khou,",
            "Nchu nzanghna dui tizang o.",
            "",
            "3. Ata ninga tari tuang e thei,",
            "Kidron duile tuna kau e thei,",
            "Rei khou tei tizang louni tuang e,",
            "Nang ta ninga taripui tuang e",
            "Abumaeng tatna dui tizang tiu.",
            "",
            "4. Ai tat sini ‘bui tuang sulouni?",
            "Poubaomei tari kimdiu khang tei,",
            "Ai ruina ramh khatsini thai mak,",
            "Tatmu tatni the Kalvary thang,",
            "Kazei luang keimei sini thutni.",
            "",
            "5. Kalvary le, He Jerusalem!",
            "Nzaenghmei Pubaomei zaulou o,",
            "Aniu pap khang ruui rianra tuang e,",
            "Tatna kazanh nthanmei bam khou,",
            "Tingkauh lauziunaa theilou puinung."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
